      "writtenOn": "2026-01-09T13:07:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wouldn\u0027t it be better to improve the functionality in RJE to go through the repository list in order. That would then only print warnings for the repositories only hosted by Google and these could maybe also made a debug log, printing a warning only, if there is no repository that contains the artifact.\n\nI don\u0027t feel it should be necessary for us to make it more complicated for ourselves just to get rid of IMO overly verbose warnings.",
      "parentUuid": "b073794e_59363260",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "fa010c8e61d204674b13beb36bf9b5679d9d59e3",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
